    <h1 class="h-hero mt-5">We stand with <mark style="background:#FFD700;color:#0057B7">Ukraine</mark></h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">Elysium+ was born in Chernihiv, Ukraine, and our work has never been separate from the war that has tried to erase our communities since 2014. We write this not as distant observers, but as a network rooted in the places where people were besieged, forced into basements, and made to bury their neighbours in their own gardens. Every claim on this page links to a source you can check yourself.</p>
  </div>
